The method also handles potential issues during the file reading process by implementing robust exception handling and ensuring the stream is closed properly, even if an exception occurs. Additionally, the method checks if a theme bitmap is already in use and recycles it if necessary, verifies if a default theme directory is configured, initializes it using a configuration file located at `/config/theme.properties` if not, parses PNG files from the cache root directory and adds them to the theme cache only if they are not corrupted and their dimensions match predefined criteria, and logs detailed error messages for any failed operations, including file parsing and theme caching, for debugging and monitoring purposes.

