The function then creates a new instance of the `MemoryStream` class using the ciphertext as input. It creates a new instance of the `CryptoStream` class using the `CreateDecryptor()` method of the `Aes` object, passing in the `MemoryStream` object and setting the mode to `CryptoStreamMode.Read`.

Finally, it creates a new instance of the `StreamReader` class using the `CryptoStream` object and reads the entire stream into a string using the `ReadToEnd()` method. It returns the decrypted plaintext as a string.

